flowchart TD
  A[HR user - React UI] --> B[FastAPI]
  B --> C{Resume source}
  C -->|Text| D[Normalize and truncate]
  C -->|PDF| E[PyMuPDF extraction]
  E -->|No usable text| F[OCR.space or local Tesseract]
  F --> D
  D --> G[Prompt with untrusted document boundaries]
  G --> H[Gemini primary]
  H -->|Failure| I[Groq fallback]
  H --> J[JSON parsing and Pydantic validation]
  I --> J
  J -->|Invalid| K[One repair attempt]
  K --> J
  J --> L[SQLAlchemy persistence]
  L --> M[SQLite or Supabase PostgreSQL]
  L --> N[Validated report to UI]
  N --> O[History search and score filters]
